@guide H_Arathi
@name Arathi Highlands (Hammerfall)
@faction Horde
@levels 32-35
@zone Arathi Highlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Hammerfall: the raising spirits and raptor quests, Call to Arms at Stromgarde, the sigils and the Shards of Myzrael.
@next H_Stranglethorn

